# Drifting Relay Buoy (CIPlay drifting_relay_buoy): the sand bar at 1 m round 0 0, the buoy round 12 0; the buoy, the
# message, the box, the lamp, the answer.
island Drifting Relay Buoy
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Relay Buoy
expect hidden relayanswer
zone buoy
expect step 1
read Relay message
expect step 2
open Buoy box
wait 3
expect step 3
use buoylamp
expect shown relayanswer
expect step 4
# (story pass 10-24: the blue hole is optional; the strips on the bar, the mast, the Keeper's log on the peak)
read Relay strip: Hedda
read Relay strip: Teo
zone rb_dive
air rb_air
open Relay 6 chest
wait 3
open Relay 6 float box
wait 3
dig 1
climb -21.91 -11.97
open Mast stash
wait 3
read Dune cairn
dig 0
zone rb_top
expect step 5
open Mast locker
wait 3
read Keeper's log: Relay 7
expect step 6
read Relay answer
expect done
